diagnostics and real-time information of your car, smart bands for medical insights and your phone acting as a field gateway to communicate with the IoT Hub. The data we get from the phone and OBD device will be stored and analyzed using Azure services based on several inputs. This would enable meaningful insights on users driving behavior.   In case of emergency, nearby devices will be alerted immediately and a signal will be sent to our central server, which will send the location of the accident to the nearest emergency centers. This will also act as a base for smart traffic management system.","topics":[],"score":1668.0,"global_rank":444425},{"name":"charchil10/App_Store_Database_Design","owner":"charchil10","html_url":"https://github.com/charchil10/App_Store_Database_Design","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Modeled a scalable normalized database & E-R model for online store of mobile apps, exploiting Toad Data Modeler","topics":[],"score":1668.0,"global_rank":444426},{"name":"martin00001313/ANN-activation-distribution","owner":"martin00001313","html_url":"https://github.com/martin00001313/ANN-activation-distribution","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Activation distribution in a neural network/ thesis","topics":[],"score":1668.0,"global_rank":444427},{"name":"vritant24/ProsePro","owner":"vritant24","html_url":"https://github.com/vritant24/ProsePro","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A Word Processor for Professional and Hobbyist writer, with inbuilt version control functionality","topics":[],"score":1668.0,"global_rank":444428},{"name":"marchese29/ReachForTheStars","owner":"marchese29","html_url":"https://github.com/marchese29/ReachForTheStars","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Points at stars n' stuff","topics":[],"score":1668.0,"global_rank":444429},{"name":"natebru/AzureARMMods","owner